# The image only needs requirements.txt and apprise_api/, so send nothing else
# to Docker. New files in the project stay on your machine automatically.
*
!requirements.txt
!apprise_api/

# Leftovers inside apprise_api/ that must not reach the image
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/.web_auth_secret*

# Translations are compiled fresh during the build, never copied in
**/*.mo

# Local data from running the API outside Docker
apprise_api/var
